<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras BR 11-mo net $120.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras BR 11-mo net $120.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil products distributor Petrobras BR Distribuidora, a unit of federal oil monopoly Petrobras, released the following 11-month 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>		    Jan-Nov 1996		 Jan-Nov 1995</p>
<p>    Net		$120.5 million		   $171.3 million</p>
<p>    Gross Sales    $7.976 bln		   $7.540 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures in U.S. dollars and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
</text>
